"help.text" = "Open a MIDI file with ⌘O or drag it into the window. Space plays or pauses; ⌘. stops. Click the timeline or piano roll to seek. Use the track controls to hide, mute or solo. ⌘0 restores normal speed.\n\nSupports Standard MIDI types 0 and 1 with musical tick timing. SysEx and SMPTE are not supported. Piano roll shows key durations, not sustain tails. Instruments and controllers are shared by MIDI channel; muting filters notes only. No sheet-music conversion.";
